column52:
Not sure this is the place for it (maybe ask on the google group?) But there's two ways:<p>screen root() {
  mydiv@<div/>
  script {
     mydiv.someplugin();
  }
}<p>mydiv will be bound to a JQuery object representing the div. You can also just do this:<p>screen root() {
  script {
    $("#div").someplugin();
  }
}<p>So generally your answer is: put it in a script { ... } block.
